<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Wassalamu\'alaikum Warahmatullahi\nWabarakatuh.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2025-12-08 09:51:57', '2025-12-15 10:26:43');
